@startuml
|Player|
start
:Launch Triangular Games application;
:View graphical user interface (mouse/keyboard);

:Select game from GUI;

if (Selected game available?) then (yes)
  if (Game type supports two players?) then (yes)
    :Choose play mode (alone / against another person);
  else (no)
    :Play mode = alone;
  endif

  :Play selected triangulation game;
  :End game session;
else (no)
  |System|
  :Show error / game not selectable;
  |Player|
endif

|Game Developer|
:Define new game (using provided documentation);
:Package game as add-on (no modification to original application);

|System|
:Detect added game;
:Register game for GUI selection;

|Player|
:New game appears in GUI and is selectable;

stop
@enduml